hips is a reading; all ships is stored. Air Assault Armor, Combat Pod, Flight System Combat, Jet Packs and Jump Bike Combat are left available and need a human reading. || TECHNICAL: +10% stored; +15% to art and language skills is in the note only. || HAND TO HAND: Basic, to Expert for one related skill or Martial Arts for two; no Assassin option is printed. || MONEY: 2D4x100 credits stored (the text layer prints 2D4xlOO); the 2D4x100 in tradeable goods, including artifacts, is in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: one weapon for each W.P.; a folding shovel, a box of 100 sealable plastic sandwich bags, a box of 100 large sealable plastic bags (the text layer prints scalable), a bed roll, a belt, a note or sketch pad and personal items have no catalog row. The box of matches maps to disposable-lighter-or-box-of-200-matches, the hand axe to hand-axe-utility, extra lead to mechanical-pencil-lead-24-in-a-pack. || NOT STORED: the vehicle, Secret Resources and the note on War Camp suspicion are prose in restrictions and GM Notes."
